## Statement of changes

This is a modified derivative of `home-assistant/android`, obtained via the fork
`nesror/Home-Assistant-Companion-for-Android`. Modifications were made in October 2026 and are
identified by the commit history of this repository; a human-readable summary of every deviation
from upstream is kept in `docs/CHANGES-VS-UPSTREAM.md` and `CHANGELOG.md`.

Notable modifications relative to upstream:

  - The location sensor is reimplemented for the `minimal` product flavour using only public
    `android.location` APIs, because platform geofencing (`Geofence`, `LocationManager.addGeofences`)
    is not part of the public Android SDK and exists only inside Google Play services.
  - The `full` flavour is retained but is not published from this repository.
  - The application id, signing key and product name differ from upstream.
  - Firebase Cloud Messaging, Crashlytics and the upstream crash-reporting backends are not enabled:
    no telemetry of this build is delivered to any third-party project.
  - The in-app "check for updates" / APK self-install path present in the fork this project branched
    from has been removed entirely.

